Its weights are subject to the Meta Llama 3 Community License and acceptable
use policy. The SOMA motion weights use the NVIDIA Open Model License.
These model licenses do not become GPL by use with this extension.

The original Make-It-Animatable model code is MIT licensed. Its models_ae.py
derives from 1zb/3DShape2VecSet, MIT licensed. The selected original MIA
checkpoint model card identifies its weights as Apache-2.0. Neither ARP nor
the original Blender, UI, dataset or pose modules are imported by our adapter.
